      "seed": 1652750254,
      "version": 177,
      "versionNonce": 2064626106,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783099039121,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "network fundamentals\n- lan: local with wires \n- wlan: local without wires\n- wan: wide area",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "network fundamentals\n- lan: local with wires \n- wlan: local without wires\n- wan: wide area",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9TMXIIbO9fZ9zXny7WSp9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15299.400069,
      "y": 2625.7171029999995,
      "width": 560.3834838867188,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bShM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1204670446,
      "version": 226,
      "versionNonce": 1145626342,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783099039121,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "VPC: private network \n    - no public IP address\n    - accept incoming traffic from allowed IP addresses (on given ports)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VPC: private network \n    - no public IP address\n    - accept incoming traffic from allowed IP addresses (on given ports)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DhtwmUY68tD2pxT3Xsiw2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 14053.041795789472,
      "y": 3071.25423,
      "width": 101.55191040039062,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bShMV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 533597983,
      "version": 88,
      "versionNonce": 677735034,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783099039121,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Url shortner ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Url shortner ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Lo6CThvScrLjNjO6JI-Jz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13965.926199842384,
      "y": 3154.3936206689264,
      "width": 764.6552734375,
      "height": 820,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bShN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 477473361,
      "version": 1579,
      "versionNonce": 181932582,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783099039121,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements\n    - functional: user should be able to...\n        - input long url and transform it to short one\n        - short one should map to the long / user should be able to access long url through short \n     \n\n    - non-functional: the system should behave...\n        - 1. CAP theorem?\n                - different portions of the system might have a different C/A balance\n        - availability > consistency\n        - 2. write to read ratio?\n            - most users will just access it \n            - few users will generate url\n            - 1:100/1:1000\n        - generated url needs to be short\n                            - need to be unique   \n                            - have an expiry date \n         \nCore Entities\n    - Url/Link\n        - shortUrl\n        - longUrl \n        - creationTime\n        - expiresIn?\n        \n    - User\n        - personalizedLink?\n    \nAPI Design \n    - contract of how we interact with the data\n    - 1:1 map to functional requirements \n\nHigh-level\n    - functional requirements\n    - use \"math\" more heavily when it starts influencing the design \n\nDeep dive\n    - non-functional \n\n    - how will we map the short to the long one? \n    - how will we expire the urls?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements\n    - functional: user should be able to...\n        - input long url and transform it to short one\n        - short one should map to the long / user should be able to access long url through short \n     \n\n    - non-functional: the system should behave...\n        - 1. CAP theorem?\n                - different portions of the system might have a different C/A balance\n        - availability > consistency\n        - 2. write to read ratio?\n            - most users will just access it \n            - few users will generate url\n            - 1:100/1:1000\n        - generated url needs to be short\n                            - need to be unique   \n                            - have an expiry date \n         \nCore Entities\n    - Url/Link\n        - shortUrl\n        - longUrl \n        - creationTime\n        - expiresIn?\n        \n    - User\n        - personalizedLink?\n    \nAPI Design \n    - contract of how we interact with the data\n    - 1:1 map to functional requirements \n\nHigh-level\n    - functional requirements\n    - use \"math\" more heavily when it starts influencing the design \n\nDeep dive\n    - non-functional \n\n    - how will we map the short to the long one? \n    - how will we expire the urls?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
