      "updated": 1783099039121,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "how do we avoid url clashes?\nhow do transform this? \n- random base62 value \nhow do we ensure low latency on the GET requests?\n\nwhen to duplicate the db? How big is the size that would demand a different db?\nwhat do we do we when the cache gets full?\n    - replacement: \n        - Least recently used [LRU]\n        - Least frequently used [LFU]",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
